      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782376536663,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "232. [!] FortiOS Overview\n233. [i] FortiGate Hardware vs VM\n234. [!] Fortinet Security Fabric\n235. [~] FortiManager\n236. [~] FortiAnalyzer\n237. [~] FortiClient\n238. [!] Firewall Policy (src/dst/svc/schedule)\n239. [!] Policy Matching Order\n240. [!] Central NAT vs Per-Policy NAT\n241. [!] Virtual IP (VIP) / DNAT\n242. [!] Traffic Shaping Policy\n243. [!] Policy Route\n244. [!] VDOM (Virtual Domain)\n245. [!] HA - FGCP Active-Passive\n246. [~] HA - Active-Active and Session Pickup\n247. [i] Heartbeat Interface\n248. [!] SSL Inspection - Certificate Mode\n249. [!] SSL Inspection - Full/Deep Mode\n250. [!] Web Filtering (FortiGate)\n251. [!] Application Control (FortiGate)\n252. [!] Antivirus Profile and Scan Modes\n253. [!] IPS Profile and Signatures\n254. [~] DLP Sensor\n255. [!] Firewall Authentication Methods\n256. [!] FSSO (Fortinet SSO)\n257. [~] FortiToken (2FA)\n258. [~] FortiAuthenticator\n259. [~] Explicit vs Transparent Proxy\n260. [!] IPsec VPN on FortiGate - hands-on: FortiGate GUI\n261. [!] SSL VPN on FortiGate - hands-on: FortiGate GUI\n262. [!] SD-WAN Rules (FortiGate)\n263. [~] BGP on FortiGate\n264. [i] ZTNA on FortiGate\n265. [~] FortiSASE\n266. [i] Inline CASB (FortiGate)\n267. [!] FortiGuard Services\n268. [!] diagnose debug flow - hands-on: FortiGate CLI\n269. [!] diagnose sys session list - hands-on: FortiGate CLI\n270. [~] get system interface physical - hands-on: FortiGate CLI\n271. [i] Default Admin Port 443 and First Login\n272. [~] Firmware Upgrade Process\n273. [i] FortiGate Cookbook (docs)\n274. [~] FortiGate REST API\n275. [~] Local-in Policy\n276. [!] Logging Severity Levels\n277. [~] Multicast Policy\n278. [i] Explicit Web Proxy Authentication\n279. [~] FortiGate Auto-Scaling (Public Cloud)\n280. [i] NSE Certification Track (NSE1 to NSE8 overview)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "232. [!] FortiOS Overview\n233. [i] FortiGate Hardware vs VM\n234. [!] Fortinet Security Fabric\n235. [~] FortiManager\n236. [~] FortiAnalyzer\n237. [~] FortiClient\n238. [!] Firewall Policy (src/dst/svc/schedule)\n239. [!] Policy Matching Order\n240. [!] Central NAT vs Per-Policy NAT\n241. [!] Virtual IP (VIP) / DNAT\n242. [!] Traffic Shaping Policy\n243. [!] Policy Route\n244. [!] VDOM (Virtual Domain)\n245. [!] HA - FGCP Active-Passive\n246. [~] HA - Active-Active and Session Pickup\n247. [i] Heartbeat Interface\n248. [!] SSL Inspection - Certificate Mode\n249. [!] SSL Inspection - Full/Deep Mode\n250. [!] Web Filtering (FortiGate)\n251. [!] Application Control (FortiGate)\n252. [!] Antivirus Profile and Scan Modes\n253. [!] IPS Profile and Signatures\n254. [~] DLP Sensor\n255. [!] Firewall Authentication Methods\n256. [!] FSSO (Fortinet SSO)\n257. [~] FortiToken (2FA)\n258. [~] FortiAuthenticator\n259. [~] Explicit vs Transparent Proxy\n260. [!] IPsec VPN on FortiGate - hands-on: FortiGate GUI\n261. [!] SSL VPN on FortiGate - hands-on: FortiGate GUI\n262. [!] SD-WAN Rules (FortiGate)\n263. [~] BGP on FortiGate\n264. [i] ZTNA on FortiGate\n265. [~] FortiSASE\n266. [i] Inline CASB (FortiGate)\n267. [!] FortiGuard Services\n268. [!] diagnose debug flow - hands-on: FortiGate CLI\n269. [!] diagnose sys session list - hands-on: FortiGate CLI\n270. [~] get system interface physical - hands-on: FortiGate CLI\n271. [i] Default Admin Port 443 and First Login\n272. [~] Firmware Upgrade Process\n273. [i] FortiGate Cookbook (docs)\n274. [~] FortiGate REST API\n275. [~] Local-in Policy\n276. [!] Logging Severity Levels\n277. [~] Multicast Policy\n278. [i] Explicit Web Proxy Authentication\n279. [~] FortiGate Auto-Scaling (Public Cloud)\n280. [i] NSE Certification Track (NSE1 to NSE8 overview)",
